ALL CHECKS PASSED   (verify_exit=0)
```

The verifier cross-checks each row against the matching input record by `id` (status dropped, username/email retained, date-formatted login, role count, primary role or null), confirms the row set is exactly the 346 `active` users, and runs `jq $(yq -r '.args[]' ...) "$(yq -r '.filter' ...)" /app/users.json` byte-compared against the delivered report. `cmd.sh` also runs correctly from a different working directory since both paths are absolute.

